Date: Sat, 22 Aug 2026 11:35:11 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] W1-01 ZGC: GC pressure benchmark harness

Standalone allocation-pressure harness (main() or programmatic run()):
configurable churn rate and live-set size; reports allocation rate,
GC count/time deltas, gc-time percent, post-GC heap. Not wired to
server startup; intended for baseline vs W1-01 comparisons across
GC Pause / Allocation Rate / Heap / CPU / Startup (never TPS alone).
